"cache_write_tokens":0.0,"input_tokens":24538.0,"llm_calls":1,"output_tokens":1034.0,"requests":3}}}},"findings":[{"block_threshold":0.9,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Force a stable locale for the git invocations feeding the signature parser (e.g. run git with LC_ALL=C / GIT_* env) or parse structured output, so detection is locale-independent.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5b","T5e","T6","T9","project.portability"],"criteria":["project.portability"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.0111,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan mechanism: 'detect the \"untracked working tree files would be overwritten by merge\" signature and parse the exact paths git names.'","git routes user-facing error strings through gettext; the surrounding _union_merge runs 'wherever reconverge runs', which per the matrix includes any platform/venue with an arbitrary locale."],"finding":"Self-heal keys on the English git error text 'untracked working tree files would be overwritten by merge'; git localizes its diagnostics via LC_MESSAGES/locale, so under a non-C/non-English locale the signature match fails and the recovery never fires.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f02e4475e7cca670b","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Fix (primary) — 'detect the \"untracked working tree files would be overwritten by merge\" signature and parse the exact paths git names'","norm_id":"nf20dbbee871cbe43","priority":0.8889,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Developer workstation or CI runner (Linux/Windows/macOS) with LC_MESSAGES set to a non-English locale (e.g. LANG=de_DE.UTF-8): git emits the localized abort message, the substring/regex match misses, the retry never triggers, and the store wedges exactly as before the fix."],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"Invoke the merge with LC_ALL=C (or LC_MESSAGES=C) in the subprocess env so git emits the English signature the parser expects on every platform/locale.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.8889,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"contradicts_reality","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"medium","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":null,"blocking_enabled":null,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["P6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":null,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["2 criterion line(s) bundle multiple deliverables with 'and' (split so each is independently verifiable).","AC item '[operator-attested] `make lint` and `make typecheck` clean; change lands via Ger' is [operator-attested] but its provenance declaration is incomplete (environment is missing (no provenance declaration found); principal is missing (no provenance declaration found); privilege_posture is missing (no provenance declaration found); instrument is missing (no provenance declaration found); justification is missing (no provenance declaration found)); add an indented continuation line 'provenance: environment=<v>; principal=<v>; privilege_posture=<production-equivalent|broader|narrower>; instrument=<live-call|simulation|static-analysis> — <justification>' under the checkbox."],"finding":"Acceptance-criteria / definition-of-done quality issues.","group_criteri